  "contracts": {
    "ordinaryFontBoxes": "Use each selected same-face horizontal owner font box and actual glyph or empty-strut baseline. Round ascent/descent separately; the supplied16px face uses15+4=19, and40px uses38+11=49. Keep raw Core metrics and annotation/positioning bounds separate.",
    "shortAndZeroFlow": "Preserve real text and paint with positive, short, mixed-size or zero leading. Real hidden/visible line boxes separate adjoining margins; positioned-only markers retain static anchors without creating flow or changing surrounding font metrics.",
    "interruptedPaint": "Retain fragment background/foreground order, all nested whole effect layers and saved glyphs, with one opacity/transform envelope per owning effect. Preserve native-matching negative positioned layer order and deferred outlines.",
    "insetShadows": "Resolve origin, extent, radii and clipping through the existing padding-box owner using actual effective border insets. Ordinary/generated callers carry their borders; root and table-row zero-border overrides remain explicit.",
    "provider": "Use released AngleSharp.Css1.1.3 through the existing adapter; preserve zero blur before positive/negative spread during serialization. Static AngleSharp remains1.8.3; the isolated worker retains its qualified353ad27c core fork."
  },
